OL,3,GNEWSASeven men face no charges in
OL,4,Amurder inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder over the death of a man more
OL,8,Fthan three years ago will face no
OL,9,Fcharges.
OL,11,FMatthew Schofield, 34, died in the
OL,12,Fearly hours of 11 June 2023, after
OL,13,Fbeing found unresponsive in Belgrave
OL,14,FRoad, Leicester, following an assault.
OL,16,FOn Monday, Leicestershire Police said
OL,17,Fseven men had been released with no
OL,18,Ffurther action.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
