OL,3,GNEWSASeven men face no charges in
OL,4,Amurder inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn total, 19 people were arrested in
OL,7,Fconnection with the investigation.
OL,8,FPolice said six men and one woman
OL,9,Fremained suspects after being arrested
OL,10,Fon suspicion of assisting an offender.
OL,11,FNobody has ever been charged.
